@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR1,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不用我说大家也知道，<br>手机的屏幕会发光。<br>而且我们手上这款手机<br>还有手电筒功能。|#0203Trial05_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:凶手事先在预定地点<br>放置一部手机，<br>并让手机一直发光。|#0203Trial05_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而案发当时<br>中庭一片漆黑……|#0203Trial05_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"那么<br>就算手机的光很微弱，<br>作为<link=\"Objection_02_03_05_01\">标记</link>也应该<br>很显眼<br>才对！|#0203Trial05_Sherry004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR13,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"只要朝着发光位置一推，<br>铁栅就会把人一下刺穿，<br>凶手就能<link=\"Objection_02_03_05_02\">达到杀人目的</link>了呢！|#0203Trial05_Sherry005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR3,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"的确，<br><link=\"Objection_02_03_05_03\">手机的光那么暗</link>，<br>大叔我没发现<br>也很正常……<br>|#0203Trial05_Miria001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR11,ArmL10,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:怎么样，<br>我这次推理得不错吧！|#0203Trial05_Sherry006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR13,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:只要使用这个诡计，<br>就能轻易做到<br>利用铁栅栏<br>杀死安安！|#0203Trial05_Sherry007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


